MODULE: BindingConvergesScanWrongPhysical
TARGET: BindingConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the shadow scan reads a different physical copy than the captured floor and binding
PERTURBS: Scan

--- FIND
    /\ shadow' = source[candidate] /\ phase' = "scanned"
--- REPLACE
    /\ shadow' = source[3 - candidate] /\ phase' = "scanned"
--- END
